The standard .NET Foundation license header was deleted from the top of the file:

::diff{file="src/OpenApi/gen/XmlCommentGenerator.Emitter.cs" lines="1-3"}

Every other file in `src/OpenApi/gen` keeps this header, and the repo's analyzers and policies expect it. It looks accidental.

::suggestion{file="src/OpenApi/gen/XmlCommentGenerator.Emitter.cs" lines="1-1"}
