using System.Collections.Generic;

The `metadata is not null &&` guard is the minimal correct fix for #64185:

::code{file="src/OpenApi/gen/XmlCommentGenerator.Emitter.cs" lines="441-448"}

The new `SupportsRouteParametersFromControllers` test reproduces the real failure. `Get()` has no `userId` argument, so the route parameter's `ModelMetadata` is null. The test also asserts that the `<param>` description still flows through the method-level path, so it checks both "no throw" and the actual output.
